# Server conventions

- Return JSON errors only (no raw HTML 500 pages).
- Honor `imageEngine` / model fields from the client; do not switch engines silently.
- Log the exact model/engine used on success and failure.
- Prefer clear quota/rate-limit messages for the client retry UX.
- Keep child-safety and likeness instructions in portrait/panel prompts.
- Do not add real API keys to responses or logs.
